# .gitguardignore — Git-Guard allowlist
#
# Add one pattern per line (Python regular expressions).
# Any finding whose matched text OR file path matches a pattern here
# will be silently suppressed.
#
# Lines starting with '#' are treated as comments and are ignored.
#
# Examples:
#   Suppress a specific placeholder value:
#     AKIAIOSFODNN7EXAMPLE
#
#   Suppress all findings in test fixtures:
#     tests/fixtures/
#
#   Suppress a specific JWT used in documentation:
#     eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9
